<p>PRECIPITATION AND TEMPERATURES FOR THE WEEK ENDING AUG. 3, 1997:</p>
<p>Temperatures averaged from 0.2 degree above normal in the Northwest and Northeast districts to 2.5 degrees below normal in the East Central district. Extremes 39o; 95o. Precipitation averaged from 0.09 inch above normal in the Central district to 0.72 inch below normal in the Northeast district. Greatest weekly total was 2.21 inches.</p>
